     "visible": true,
     "kicker": "MATHENE · matheme-dia-syn-syn · ARGUED",
     "title": "Syn — The Gathering",
     "italic": "Composing while source, inverse reading and affected context stay retrievable.",
     "body": "Syn composes while source, inverse reading and affected context stay retrievable. The seam is held in (0/1)/(1/0): ordinary arithmetic computes 0/1 and leaves 1/0 undefined; treating the outer stroke as fraction division loses the operation where it matters. Terms plus their four pairings: 2+2² = 6 = 4+2 — retention, not averaging. Deleting a measurement is loss; one unsupported figure is fusion; withholding the condition is counterfeit gathering.",
